(text "MCLK test pad (BOM v1 line 88)" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 210.82 129.54 0) (effects (font (size 2.54 2.54)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "4ce26b37-1feb-5f6e-9e38-1a0a23aeb30f"))
(text_box "Notes\n1. Function: Cirrus Logic CS43198 for the right channel in mono mode (dual mono, BOM v1\n   line 18): AOUTA and AOUTB a differential pair into both output stages; I2C2 address 0x31 (ADR 4.99 kΩ to ground).\n2. Absent state: never omitted (T1-040). RESET held low by the host-side pull-down; INT pulled\n   up only on DAC_DIG_1V8; I2C isolated while DAC_DIG_1V8 is off (G2).\n3. Clock slave: SCLK1 and LRCK1 from the left DAC through 0 Ω.\n   XTI/MCLK from its own divider (blk.mclk); XTO, CLKOUT, TSO and DSDB/LRCK2 unused.\n   DSD: DSDA from DSD_x, DSDCLK from I2S_BCLK (native DSD reserved, blackbird-os ADR 0006).\n4. HP_DETECT tied low: plug detection is on the jacks (expander P10, P11).\n5. VA from its own TPS7A2018 (EN = AUDIO_LN_EN) behind link L1; VL, VD, VCP on DAC_DIG_1V8;\n   VP on DAC_VP (PCB-A-05). GNDA, GNDCP, GNDD and the pad in one ground (PCB-A-01, -02).\n6. Open: series values other than 0 Ω (bring-up, G2); CS43198 pins fail-safe unpowered (UNVERIFIED)." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 275.59 219.71 0) (size 129.54 29.21) (margins 1.905 1.905 1.905 1.905) (stroke (width 0) (type default)) (fill (type none)) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "27c1368f-8a6d-5a3c-a38d-a2854a57cd57"))
(text "Interface" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 22.86 226.06 0) (effects (font (size 2.54 2.54)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "fb8bf102-e822-5ce4-8193-28f08535023b"))
